,{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Array of sequence definitions, or getter returning them"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"commonoptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"commonOptions?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"| "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InjectHotkeySequenceOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n| (() => "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InjectHotkeySequenceOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shared options for all sequences, or getter"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"@Component({ ... })\nexport class VimComponent {\n  constructor() {\n    injectHotkeySequences([\n      { sequence: ['G', 'G'], callback: () => this.goTop() },\n      { sequence: ['D', 'D'], callback: () => this.deleteLine() },\n    ])\n  }\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"sequences","text":"sequences","level":3},{"id":"commonoptions","text":"commonOptions?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction injectHotkeySequences(sequences, commonOptions?): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [injectHotkeySequences.ts:51](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectHotkeySequences.ts#L51)\n\nAngular inject-based API for registering multiple keyboard shortcut sequences at once (Vim-style).\n\nUses the singleton SequenceManager. Call in an injection context (e.g. constructor).\nUses `effect()` to track reactive dependencies when definitions or options are getters.\n\nOptions are merged in this order:\nprovideHotkeys defaults < commonOptions < per-definition options\n\nDefinitions with an empty `sequence` are skipped. Disabled sequences (`enabled: false`)\nremain registered so they stay visible in devtools; the core manager suppresses execution.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### sequences\n\n  \\| [`InjectHotkeySequenceDefinition`](../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceDefinition.md)[]\n  \\| (() => [`InjectHotkeySequenceDefinition`](../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceDefinition.md)[])\n\nArray of sequence definitions, or getter returning them\n\n### commonOptions?\n\n  \\| [`InjectHotkeySequenceOptions`](../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceOptions.md)\n  \\| (() => [`InjectHotkeySequenceOptions`](../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceOptions.md))\n\nShared options for all sequences, or getter\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n@Component({ ... })\nexport class VimComponent {\n  constructor() {\n    injectHotkeySequences([\n      { sequence: ['G', 'G'], callback: () => this.goTop() },\n      { sequence: ['D', 'D'], callback: () => this.deleteLine() },\n    ])\n  }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: injectHotkeySequences\ntitle: injectHotkeySequences\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction injectHotkeySequences(sequences, commonOptions?): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [injectHotkeySequences.ts:51](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectHotkeySequences.ts#L51)\n\nAngular inject-based API for registering multiple keyboard shortcut sequences at once (Vim-style).\n\nUses the singleton SequenceManager. Call in an injection context (e.g. constructor).\nUses `effect()` to track reactive dependencies when definitions or options are getters.\n\nOptions are merged in this order:\nprovideHotkeys defaults < commonOptions < per-definition options\n\nDefinitions with an empty `sequence` are skipped. Disabled sequences (`enabled: false`)\nremain registered so they stay visible in devtools; the core manager suppresses execution.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### sequences\n\n  \\| [`InjectHotkeySequenceDefinition`](../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceDefinition.md)[]\n  \\| (() => [`InjectHotkeySequenceDefinition`](../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceDefinition.md)[])\n\nArray of sequence definitions, or getter returning them\n\n### commonOptions?\n\n  \\| [`InjectHotkeySequenceOptions`](../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceOptions.md)\n  \\| (() => [`InjectHotkeySequenceOptions`](../interfaces/InjectHotkeySequenceOptions.md))\n\nShared options for all sequences, or getter\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n@Component({ ... })\nexport class VimComponent {\n  constructor() {\n    injectHotkeySequences([\n      { sequence: ['G', 'G'], callback: () => this.goTop() },\n      { sequence: ['D', 'D'], callback: () => this.deleteLine() },\n    ])\n  }\n}\n```\n"}
